# =========================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages Routing & API Proxy Rules
# =========================================================================
#
# Vite automatic copy:
# Any files in 'frontend/public' are copied directly to the 'dist' build root.
# Cloudflare Pages dynamically reads this '_redirects' file upon deployment.

# 1. API Proxing Configuration:
# Redirects /api/* requests safely from Cloudflare Pages to the Worker edge backend.
# REPLACE 'your-subdomain' with your active Cloudflare Worker subdomain:
# (e.g. '/api/* https://mrcpch-study-platform.drkathirmrcpch.workers.dev/api/:splat 200')
/api/* https://mrcpch-study-platform.your-subdomain.workers.dev/api/:splat 200

# 2. SPA Fallback Routing:
# Compiles route parameters of client-side react-router / state engines directly to index.html.
# This prevents 404 errors when pages are reloaded or directly visited.
/* /index.html 200
